# Route: guide 11 of 53 of the simulator's completionist route for NightElf
# (1445 of 1459 eligible quests, 164.6 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 32 to
# 34, 46 quests, 4.8 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Stormwind City, Wetlands, Arathi Highlands, Thousand Needles, Dun
# Morogh): near Stormwind City -> Stormwind City -> near Stormwind City ->
# Stormwind -> near Stormwind -> Stormwind City -> near Stormwind City -> near
# Stormwind -> near Stormwind City -> Whelgar's Excavation Site -> Angerfang
# Encampment -> Direforge Hill -> Dun Modr -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Oh Brother... (167; Foreman
# Thistlenettle 20); Collecting Memories (168; Skeletal Miner 17-18, Undead
# Excavator 17-18, Undead Dynamiter 17-18); The Dark Iron War (303; Dark Iron
# Dwarf 27-28, Dark Iron Tunneler 29-30, Dark Iron Saboteur 28-29, Dark Iron
# Demolitionist 30-31); A Grim Task (304; Balgaras the Foul 34); Encrusted
# Tail Fins (1107; Saltscale Warrior 35-36, Saltscale Oracle 36-37, Saltscale
# Tide Lord 37, Saltscale Forager 35-36, Saltscale Hunter 35-36); A Host of
# Evil (6626; Razorfen Battleguard 33-34, Razorfen Thornweaver 33-34, Death's
# Head Cultist 33-34).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 2758 The
# Origins of Smithing; 2759 In Search of Galvan; 3630 Gnome Engineering; 4181
# Goblin Engineering; 7497 The Journey Has Just Begun; 5143 Tribal
# Leatherworking; 95217 The Quarry's Smith; 96031 Camping 101: Leatherworking;
# 96044 Camping 101: Blacksmithing; 96046 Camping 101: Mining; 96047 Camping
# 101: First Aid; 96050 Camping 101: Fishing; 96055 Camping 101: Herbalism;
# 96056 Camping 101: Skinning; 96057 Camping 101: Tailoring; 96058 Camping
# 101: Engineering.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Quell The Uprising (387), Quell the Uprising (387), The
# Color of Blood (388), The Color of Blood (388), The Stockade Riots (391),
# The Stockade Riots (391), Underground Assault (2040), Underground Assault
# (2040), Bring the Light (3636), A Green Sample (92456), A Green Sample
# (92456), Power Overwhelming (92489), Power Overwhelming (92489), The Fury
# Runs Deep (378), The Fury Runs Deep (378), Lost in the Thicket Things
# (95647), Fallen in the Fen (95795), Heartwoven (95809), Highland Hides
# (98815), Highland Hides (98815), Prehistoric Prism (98824), Prehistoric
# Prism (98824), The Crone of the Kraul (1101), Gahz'rilla (2770), A Fine Mess
# (2904), The Sparklematic 5200! (2951), The Only Cure is More Green Glow
# (2962), The Only Cure is More Green Glow (2962), Hurley Blackbreath (4126),
# Old Ironforge Incursion (96393), Old Ironforge Incursion (96393).

